<title>USA: UAW members in U.S. ratify UAW-Chrysler pact.</title>
<headline>UAW members in U.S. ratify UAW-Chrysler pact.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Auto Workers members at Chrysler Corp in the United States have voted to ratify new three-year agreements covering hourly and salaried workers, said UAW president Stephen Yokich and vice president Jack Laskowski, director of the UAW-Chrysler Department.</p>
<p>The ballot count revealed that 73 percent voted in favor of the pact.</p>
</text>
